		'/ai-consultancy/ai-automation/' => array(
			'intro' => '<p>AI automation uses artificial intelligence to carry out work that used to need a person — reading documents, answering enquiries, updating systems, making routine decisions. Alugence designs and builds AI agents and intelligent workflows that take real tasks off your team\'s plate, cut manual effort, and scale with your business.</p>',
			'def' => '<p>AI automation is the use of AI — including AI agents and large language models — to complete tasks and workflows with little or no human input. Unlike traditional rule-based automation, which follows fixed scripts, AI automation can handle unstructured inputs, make judgements, and adapt. An AI agent is a system that can take goals, plan steps and act across tools to complete a task. Learn more in our guide: <a href="/guides/what-is-agentic-ai/">What is agentic AI?</a></p>',
			'cards' => array(array('title'=>'AI agents','body'=>'<p>Autonomous agents that plan and act across your tools to complete multi-step tasks.</p>'),array('title'=>'Workflow automation','body'=>'<p>End-to-end automation of processes like onboarding, invoicing, reporting and support triage.</p>'),array('title'=>'Document & data processing','body'=>'<p>Extracting, summarising and routing information from emails, PDFs and forms.</p>'),array('title'=>'Integration','body'=>'<p>Connecting automations to your CRM, ERP and other systems so they act on live data.</p>')),
			'steps' => array(array('name'=>'Map','desc'=>'the process and find the high-value, high-volume tasks.'),array('name'=>'Design','desc'=>'the automation or agent and its guardrails.'),array('name'=>'Build','desc'=>'and connect it to your tools.'),array('name'=>'Test','desc'=>'against real cases and measure time saved.'),array('name'=>'Scale','desc'=>'to more tasks and teams.')),
			'outcomes' => '<ul><li>Hours of manual work removed each week (estimate yours with the <a href="/tools/ai-roi-calculator/">ROI calculator</a>).</li><li>Faster turnaround and fewer errors on routine processes.</li><li>Staff freed for higher-value work.</li><li>Automations that scale without proportional headcount.</li></ul>',
			'who' => '<p>Any admin-heavy or process-heavy business — from professional services and finance to healthcare and logistics. If your team spends hours on repetitive tasks, AI automation usually pays back fastest.</p>',
			'faqs' => array(array('What is the difference between AI automation and traditional automation?','Traditional automation follows fixed rules and needs structured inputs; AI automation handles unstructured information, makes judgements and adapts. For example, rules-based automation can move a file when a field changes, but AI automation can read a free-text email, decide what it\'s about, and act. See Agentic AI vs traditional automation.'),array('What is an AI agent?','An AI agent is a system that takes a goal, plans the steps to achieve it, and acts across multiple tools with limited human input. Agents can, for instance, read a request, look up records, draft a response and update a system — checking in with a person where needed. Our guide explains more: What is agentic AI?'),array('Which processes are best to automate first?','Start with tasks that are high-volume, repetitive, rule-guided or admin-heavy — data entry, document processing, triage, reporting and routine customer comms. We map your processes and prioritise by value, effort and risk before building anything.'),array('Is AI automation safe and reliable?','Yes, when it\'s built with guardrails, human-in-the-loop checks for higher-risk steps, and monitoring. We design automations to escalate edge cases to a person and log their actions, and we align controls with your governance requirements.')),
			'sections' => array(array('h'=>'What is AI automation?','html'=>'<p>AI automation is the use of AI — including AI agents and large language models — to complete tasks and workflows with little or no human input. Unlike traditional rule-based automation, which follows fixed scripts, AI automation can handle unstructured inputs, make judgements, and adapt. An AI agent is a system that can take goals, plan steps and act across tools to complete a task. Learn more in our guide: <a href="/guides/what-is-agentic-ai/">What is agentic AI?</a></p>'),array('h'=>'What\'s included','html'=>'<h3>AI agents</h3>
<p>Autonomous agents that plan and act across your tools to complete multi-step tasks.</p>
<h3>Workflow automation</h3>
<p>End-to-end automation of processes like onboarding, invoicing, reporting and support triage.</p>
<h3>Document &amp; data processing</h3>
<p>Extracting, summarising and routing information from emails, PDFs and forms.</p>
<h3>Integration</h3>
<p>Connecting automations to your CRM, ERP and other systems so they act on live data.</p>'),array('h'=>'Our process','html'=>'<ol><li><strong>Map</strong> the process and find the high-value, high-volume tasks.</li><li><strong>Design</strong> the automation or agent and its guardrails.</li><li><strong>Build</strong> and connect it to your tools.</li><li><strong>Test</strong> against real cases and measure time saved.</li><li><strong>Scale</strong> to more tasks and teams.</li></ol>'),array('h'=>'Outcomes','html'=>'<ul><li>Hours of manual work removed each week (estimate yours with the <a href="/tools/ai-roi-calculator/">ROI calculator</a>).</li><li>Faster turnaround and fewer errors on routine processes.</li><li>Staff freed for higher-value work.</li><li>Automations that scale without proportional headcount.</li></ul>'),array('h'=>'Who this is for','html'=>'<p>Any admin-heavy or process-heavy business — from professional services and finance to healthcare and logistics. If your team spends hours on repetitive tasks, AI automation usually pays back fastest.</p>')),
