			'outcomes' => '',
			'who' => '',
			'faqs' => array(array('How quickly will you respond?','We reply to messages within one working day. Discovery calls can usually be booked within the same week via the calendar link above.'),array('Is the discovery call really free?','Yes. The 20-minute discovery call is free and carries no obligation. Its purpose is to understand your goals and recommend the right first step, not to sell you a package on the call.'),array('Do you work with US clients?','Yes. Alugence is UK-based and works with clients across the United Kingdom and United States. Calls run remotely and pricing is available in GBP and USD.'),array('What should I prepare for the call?','Nothing formal. It helps to know your main goal (adopt AI, improve AI search visibility, or both), roughly who\'s involved, and any deadline. If you\'ve used our AI ROI Calculator, bring the result.')),
			'sections' => array(array('h'=>'Send a message','html'=>'<p>[Contact form fields: Name · Work email · Company · Website · Which practice? (AI consultancy / AI search / both / not sure) · Message · Consent checkbox (GDPR).]</p>'),array('h'=>'Company details','html'=>'<ul><li><strong>Alugence [Ltd]</strong> · Company reg. no. [NUMBER]</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> [email]</li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> [phone]</li><li><strong>Location / service area:</strong> Yorkshire, United Kingdom — serving UK &amp; US clients</li><li><strong>Hours:</strong> [e.g. Mon–Fri, 9:00–17:30 GMT]</li></ul>')),
