		'/tools/ai-roi-calculator/' => array(
			'intro' => '<p>Estimate what AI could save your business in minutes. Enter a few details and this free AI ROI calculator shows the hours you\'d save each week, your likely annual cost saving, your productivity gain, and an AI readiness score out of 10. See the numbers instantly on screen — no email needed — then download a branded AI Opportunity Report if you want the full breakdown.</p>
<p>[<strong>Calculate my AI ROI</strong>] (widget below)</p>',
			'def' => '',
			'cards' => array(),
			'steps' => array(),
			'outcomes' => '',
			'who' => '',
			'faqs' => array(array('Is the AI ROI calculator free?','Yes. The calculator is completely free and shows your results instantly on screen with no email required. You only share your details if you want the full 4-page AI Opportunity Report PDF.'),array('How accurate is the estimate?','It\'s an indicative estimate, not a quote. It\'s based on the inputs you provide — team size, admin hours, hourly rate and expected savings — using a transparent formula shown on this page. Use it to build a directional business case, then validate the specifics with a scoping call.'),array('Which time-savings percentage should I choose?','Choose 20% for a conservative estimate, 35% for a typical structured programme over 6–12 months, or 50% if you\'re pursuing aggressive automation of admin-heavy work. Most SMEs land around 35% once workflows are redesigned around AI, not just layered on top.'),array('What happens to my data?','Your on-screen calculation stays in your browser — nothing is stored unless you request the report. If you download the AI Opportunity Report, we store your details to send it and one follow-up email, under GDPR: no third-party sharing, and an unsubscribe link in every email.'),array('Who is the calculator for?','It\'s built for business owners and leaders in SMEs and mid-market organisations weighing up an AI programme. It\'s sector-aware — the report tailors workflow recommendations to your industry and biggest bottleneck.'),array('What\'s the typical payback window?','Automation and efficiency projects commonly target payback within 6–12 months. Your annual saving from the calculator, set against implementation cost, gives a rough payback period; a scoping call refines it.')),
			'sections' => array(array('h'=>'The calculator','html'=>'<p><code>[Interactive widget — 11 inputs per Tab 16: employees; admin hours/employee/week; average hourly rate (GBP/USD toggle); sector; expected time savings 20/35/50%; current tools; where data lives; team AI familiarity; biggest bottleneck; previous AI attempts; appetite for change.]</code></p>
